ook brief prints raw command ids such as command-speckit-save. This phase adds the four fields, prints the command and its policy in the brief head for every family, states the degraded-path contract and retires the allow-list and the hand-authored bridge leftovers.\\\"\\n4: trigger_phrases:\\n5:   - \\\"recommendation contract and brief\\\"\\n6:   - \\\"phase 5 recommendation contract and brief\\\"\\n7: importance_tier: \\\"normal\\\"\\n8: contextType: \\\"general\\\"\\n9: ---\\n10: <!-- SPECKIT_TEMPLATE_SOURCE: spec-core | v2.4 -->\\n11: # Feature Specification: Phase 5: recommendation-contract-and-brief\\n12: \\n13: <!-- SPECKIT_LEVEL: 2 -->\\n14: ---\\n15: \\n16: <!-- ANCHOR:metadata -->\\n17: ## 1. METADATA\\n18: \\n19: | Field | Value |\\n20: |-------|-------|\\n21: | **Level** | 2 |\\n22: | **Priority** | P1 |\\n23: | **Status** | Draft |\\n24: | **Created** | 2026-11-12 |\\n25: | **Branch** | `worktrees/352-command-surfacing-research` |\\n26: | **Parent Spec** | ../spec.md |\\n27: | **Phase** | 5 of 7 |\\n28: | **Predecessor** | 004-command-meaning-matching |\\n29: | **Success..."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"pattern\":\"nm-sk-doc-01\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief\"}"},"time":{"start":1794521837333,"end":1794521839151}}}}
