{"type":"text","timestamp":1794522308910,"sessionID":"ses_e2e2a7dd5ffeKSW8P83xK0M1au","part":{"id":"prt_1d1dd49a60029IpNrInopNhrqN","sessionID":"ses_e2e2a7dd5ffeKSW8P83xK0M1au","messageID":"msg_1d1dd1f13001AaqrhswDyd6HJn","type":"text","text":"T054 is implemented. The probe writes exactly the fields the spec block shows, and the substantive verification passes.\n\n**Files written**\n- `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/scratch/nm-sk-doc-probe.mjs`\n- `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/scratch/nm-sk-doc-before.txt`\n\n**Probe output** (`node $S/nm-sk-doc-probe.mjs`, exit 0)\n```\nsystem-skilled-doctor 0.82 0.1301 [[\"lexical\",0.056,[\"token:setup\"]],[\"derived_generated\",0.0661,[\"derived:setup\"]],[\"semantic_shadow\",0.008,[\"shadow:test-fallback\"]]]\nsk-code 0.82 0.0969 [[\"lexical\",0.0812,[\"token:typo\",\"token:heading\",\"token:debug\"]],[\"graph_causal\",0.0157,[\"edge:mcp-tooling->sk-code:enhances\",\"edge:sk-design->sk-code:enhances\"]]]\nsk-design 0.82 0.0640 [[\"lexical\",0.056,[\"token:guide\"]],[\"semantic_shadow\",0.008,[\"shadow:test-fallback\"]]]\ncount 4 skdoc index -1\n```\n\n**Verification against the `spec.md` probe block**\n```\n$ diff -u <(sed -n '159,162p' spec.md) $S/nm-sk-doc-before.txt\n--- spec block\n+++ $S/nm-sk-doc-before.txt\n@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@\n-system-skilled-doctor 0.82 0.1302 [...[\"derived_generated\",0.0662,[\"derived:setup\"]]...]\n+system-skilled-doctor 0.82 0.1301 [...[\"derived_generated\",0.0661,[\"derived:setup\"]]...]\n sk-code 0.82 0.0969 [[\"lexical\",0.0812,[\"token:typo\",\"token:heading\",\"token:debug\"]],...]\n sk-design 0.82 0.0640 [...]\n count 4 skdoc index -1\n```\n```\nPASS: sk-doc absent, sk-code holds token:typo and token:heading, count line matches\n```\n\nThe required conditions match: `sk-doc` is absent, `sk-code` holds `token:typo` and `token:heading`, and every lane and evidence entry is identical. The single remaining delta is `derived_generated` `0.0662 → 0.0661` and the doctor total `0.1302 → 0.1301`. That lane uses a fractional wall-clock age haircut (`(now - derivedGeneratedAt) / 86_400_000`, 90-day half-life), so the number moves continuously. Pinning `Date` to `2026-11-12T19:30:00Z` reproduces the spec's `0.1302 / 0.0662` exactly, confirming the delta is elapsed time since the spec block was captured, not a scoring or evidence difference.\n\n**Not done**\n- `tasks.md` was not modified and the T054 checkbox was not ticked, per instruction.\n- `SKILL ROUTING: User directed → @code implementer (sk-code scope)`.","time":{"start":1794522302886,"end":1794522308910}}}
